 "is_closed": false,
 "creation-date": "2024-01-19",
 "description": "<p>The Board Development Committee enables the Board of Directors to properly discharge its duties, by assuring that its composition is appropriate, that Directors are properly informed, trained, and engaged, and that there is a sufficient, diverse, skilled set of candidates for the Consortium Member Director positions.</p>\r\n<p>Learn more in the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/2024/01/bod-development.html\">Development Committee charter</a>.</p>",
